config PX4_MSGS
	bool "px4_msgs C mirror with micro-CDR encoders"
	default n
	help
	  Hand-written C structs and micro-CDR encoders that mirror a pinned
	  subset of PX4/px4_msgs (SensorOpticalFlow, DistanceSensor, SensorGps,
	  SensorMag). Wire payload is the 4-byte CDR encapsulation header
	  00 01 00 00 followed by the CDR body in IDL field order, with the
	  RIHS01 type hash carried in the rmw_zenoh key expression.

	  Selecting this pulls in eProsima Micro-CDR from the microcdr west
	  project and builds it as a Zephyr library.
